{"schemaVersion":1,"generatedAt":"2026-11-28T05:25:35Z","note":{"ja":"財務省の統計（円建て）。証券売買は指定報告機関ベースの週次・月次で、単位は億円。対外証券投資は居住者による外国証券の取得・処分、対内証券投資は非居住者による日本の証券の取得・処分です。ネットのプラスは取得超、マイナスは処分超（原典の注記）。相手国は公表されていないため、国どうしの線にはしません。対外資産負債残高は四半期末の残高（単位は十億円）で、金融派生商品と相手地域別の残高はここにはありません。米国・欧州の統計とは別系列で、換算も合算もしません。出典は財務省（PDL 1.0）、CAPITAL PULSE が編集しました。","en":"Ministry of Finance Japan statistics in yen. International transactions in securities are weekly and monthly figures based on designated major investors, in 100 million yen. Portfolio investment assets are acquisitions and dispositions of foreign securities by residents; liabilities are acquisitions and dispositions of Japanese securities by non-residents. A positive net means net acquisition and a negative net means net disposition (the original note). The counterpart country is not published, so no country-to-country lines are drawn. The international investment position is the end-of-quarter position in billion yen; financial derivatives and positions by counterpart region are not included. These are separate series from US and European statistics and are neither converted nor added together. Source: Ministry of Finance Japan (PDL 1.0), edited by CAPITAL PULSE.","zh":"日本财务省的统计（日元计价）。证券买卖为指定报告机构口径的周度和月度数据，单位为亿日元。对外证券投资是居民对外国证券的买入与卖出，对内证券投资是非居民对日本证券的买入与卖出。净额为正表示净买入，为负表示净卖出（原文注释）。交易对手国未公布，因此不绘制国与国之间的连线。国际投资头寸为季末余额（单位：十亿日元），不含金融衍生品和按对手地区划分的余额。与美国、欧洲的统计为不同序列，不做换算或加总。来源：日本财务省（PDL 1.0），由 CAPITAL PULSE 编辑。","es":"Estadísticas del Ministerio de Finanzas de Japón en yenes. Las transacciones internacionales de valores son cifras semanales y mensuales de los inversores principales designados, en cien millones de yenes. La inversión de cartera en activos son las compras y ventas de valores extranjeros por residentes; la de pasivos, las compras y ventas de valores japoneses por no residentes. Un neto positivo es adquisición neta y uno negativo, enajenación neta (nota original). No se publica el país contraparte, por lo que no se trazan líneas entre países. La posición de inversión internacional es el saldo a fin de trimestre en miles de millones de yenes; no incluye derivados financieros ni saldos por región contraparte. Son series distintas de las de EE. UU. y Europa; no se convierten ni se suman. Fuente: Ministerio de Finanzas de Japón (PDL 1.0), editado por CAPITAL PULSE."},"securities":{"sourceId":"mof-itn","sourceUrl":"https://www.mof.go.jp/policy/international_policy/reference/itn_transactions_in_securities/week.csv","unit":"JPY_100million","counterpart":"unknown_world_total","columns":["assets.equity.acq","assets.equity.disp","assets.equity.net","assets.longTermDebt.acq","assets.longTermDebt.disp","assets.longTermDebt.net","assets.debtSubtotal.net","assets.shortTermDebt.acq","assets.shortTermDebt.disp","assets.shortTermDebt.net","assets.total.net","liabilities.equity.acq","liabilities.equity.disp","liabilities.equity.net","liabilities.longTermDebt.acq","liabilities.longTermDebt.disp","liabilities.longTermDebt.net","liabilities.debtSubtotal.net","liabilities.shortTermDebt.acq","liabilities.shortTermDebt.disp","liabilities.shortTermDebt.net","liabilities.total.net"],"signRule":{"positive":"net_acquisition","negative":"net_disposition","originalJa":"ネットのプラス（＋）は取得超、マイナス（－）は処分超を表す。","originalEn":"International Transactions in Securities show net acquisition with a plus sign(＋) and net disposition with a minus sign(－)."},"weekly":{"latestPeriod":"2026-11-15/2026-11-21","lastUpdate":"2026-11-27","rows":[["2024-11-24/2024-11-30",[27918,33365,-5447,105355,96131,9224,3777,7629,12297,-4668,-891,205236,211313,-6077,49451,47690,1761,-4317,54792,48972,5819,1503]],["2024-12-01/2024-12-07",[31803,41351,-9548,114513,120903,-6391,-15938,8320,7754,566,-15372,182200,177371,4829,63127,53131,9995,14824,46854,30953,15901,30725]],["2024-12-08/2024-12-14",[22286,21951,335,111892,104786,7106,7441,8007,8092,-85,7356,180147,186011,-5864,59616,55793,3823,-2041,43815,60934,-17118,-19160]],["2024-12-15/2024-12-21",[31219,2940